      "english": "“Silly child, you should go into the forest and ask, then you’ll know what happiness is.”"
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "晚上，熊宝宝又累又饿。",
      "traditional": "晚上，熊寶寶又累又餓。",
      "pinyin": "wǎn shang xióng bǎo bao yòu lèi yòu è",
      "english": "So, Baby Bear went to look for his friends, but no one knew what happiness meant."
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "一到家，他就看到了妈妈准备的一桌子菜。",
      "traditional": "一到家，他就看到了媽媽準備的一桌子菜。",
      "pinyin": "yí dào jiā tā jiù kàn dào le mā ma zhǔn bèi de yì zhuō zi cài",
      "english": "In the evening, Baby Bear was both tired and hungry."
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "\n    ",
      "traditional": "\n    ",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "When he got home, he saw that the table was full of dishes prepared by Mother Bear."
    },
    {
