    "sentence_translations": [
      "Mother Bear’s Happiness",
      "",
      "One day, Baby Bear asked Mother Bear: “What is happiness?”",
      "Mother Bear smiled and said:",
      "“Silly child, you should go into the forest and ask, then you’ll know what happiness is.”",
      "So, Baby Bear went to look for his friends, but no one knew what happiness meant.",
      "In the evening, Baby Bear was both tired and hungry.",
      "When he got home, he saw that the table was full of dishes prepared by Mother Bear.",
      "",
      "Baby Bear started to eat very happily.",
      "When the food was eaten up he rubbed his belly and said:",
      "“Mom, I feel very happy now. Is this happiness?”",
      "Mother Bear said: “Yes, this is happiness.”",
      "Baby Bear said: “I understand. When are you the happiest then Mom?”",
      "Mother Bear said: “My greatest happiness was that you weren’t at home for a whole day.”"
    ]
